title: Skills System Design — Ideation Session (Apr 12-13)
summary: Multi-session design exploration of a new skills system for Paradigm + Neverland co-launch on May 1. Moved from "skills as static prompt templates" to "skills as managed, versioned, goal-anchored units" with a clear north star model, identity fields, and a registry-backed management layer. No implementation yet — all ideation and design decisions.
